# Shared documentation layout

All **product planning, specs, sprint state, and ADRs** live in **this docs repo**. App repos (`client/`, `server/`, future services) consume them via a sibling `docs/` checkout or submodule—do not recreate product specs inside app trees.

Index: [`README.md`](../../README.md). Planning-only workflow: [`planning/README.md`](../../planning/README.md).

## Path spelling

| How you open the repo | Example paths |
|----------------------|---------------|
| **Docs repo root** | `features/auth.md`, `sprint/client/current.yaml` |
| **Hyreefy workspace (`ms/`)** | `docs/features/auth.md`, `docs/sprint/client/current.yaml` |
| **Inside `client/` or `server/`** | `../docs/features/auth.md`, `../docs/sprint/server/current.yaml` |
| **Hyreefy `ms/` only** | `designs/` — static HTML mockups; doc: [architecture/product-design-mockups.md](../../architecture/product-design-mockups.md) |

Sprint YAML **`doc:`** fields use paths **from the docs repo root** (e.g. `features/auth.md`, `domains/server/rbac/README.md`).

## Tree (summary)

| Path | Use |
|------|-----|
| `features/` | End-to-end feature specs (Plan + Dev) |
| `roadmap/frontend.md` | Hyreefy delivery order |
| `sprint/client/current.yaml` | Client sprint / focus |
| `sprint/server/current.yaml` | Server sprint / focus |
| `domains/client/<name>/` | Specs mirroring `client/src/domains/<name>/` |
| `domains/server/<name>/` | Specs mirroring `server/src/domains/<name>/` |
| `architecture/` | Client architecture (incl. `multi-tenancy.md`, `persistence.md`) |
| `architecture/server/` | Server API architecture |
| `adr/` | Architecture decision records |
| `planning/` | Brainstorming + deferred implementation tasks |

Framework docs (Next.js) stay in the **client** app (`node_modules/next/dist/docs/`)—not this repo.

## When you change docs

Update in the **same change set** when possible:

1. The spec or domain README you edited
2. Linked feature specs, ADRs, and domain cross-refs
3. `doc:` links in `sprint/client/current.yaml` and/or `sprint/server/current.yaml`
4. `README.md` or domain index tables if layout or naming changed
5. **Cursor rules in `docs/.cursor/rules/`** if documented paths or workflow changed

App repos symlink `consuming-repos/docs-driven-development.mdc` and `consuming-repos/sprint-progress.mdc`, plus repo-specific `hyreefy-product.mdc` (Hyreefy only).
